"lessons":"She follows through best at midday and afternoons on weekdays, with psychological capability or physical opportunity around 12:00-14:00. Intensity 1 is reliable; intensity 2 somewhat less so. Mornings are weaker. I kept demanding tasks in midday windows, spread light planning tasks across days, put alongside tasks at midday, afternoon or habitual evening times, and set the long walks on Tuesday, Friday afternoon and Sunday midday."}
